# D-2: the in-game pause menu (InGame_MainMenu, a GUI page over the world) and the scoreboard, for the owner's
# pictures (tools/dev/d2-ui-scale.sh). DM-Deadbolt, pinned view as deadbolt.scen.
wait Bringing Level DM-Deadbolt.MyLevel up for play 120
sleep 12
chan exec set UCDeathmatch NumPlayers 0
wait test: exec set UCDeathmatch NumPlayers 0 10
sleep 1
focus
# Fire until the player is in: a press and its release can fall between two frames at the low frame rates of
# big windows in software GL (3840x2160: about 2.5 s per frame), so Fire is held 3 s and repeated until a probe
# shows the pawn
seek 8 P['_'].pawn==1 ;; key Alt_L 3
sleep 3
chan exec God
wait test: exec God 10
sleep 2
keydown Tab
sleep 2.5
shot scoreboard
keyup Tab
sleep 2
key Escape 0.8
expect d2-pause-menu-opens OpenMenu 20
sleep 3
shot pause
key Escape 0.8
sleep 2
